{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Tiny Whiny Island!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, cozy open-world adventure set on a charming little island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the island\u2019s new postman, hop on your bike and pedal through scenic paths, deliver letters, and help resolve  local conflicts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udeb4\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Feel the Wind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a  physics-based cycling system that makes every hill climb, downhill sprint, and sharp corner feel dynamic and responsive. For the curious rider, secret moves are hidden in the controls. Try them out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Explore a Handcrafted World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a whimsical island filled with playful characters and fun interactions. From scattered paper airplanes to shining mushrooms, every corner hides a collectible or secret waiting to be found.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8c Connect with the Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a close-knit, small-town vibe where every delivery brings you closer to the heart of the island and its people.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922310/37b5ca90644b2a1d2d71561d17e1b581b88e14a3.jpg"},{"name":"Signed, Sealed, Delivered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922310/f9f44d72749bdffe550a6f13692fee6fcbbe3733.jpg"},{"name":"Chatty Pete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922310/c44950f9afc5d19a5cefd7326bdf2c55e061e639.jpg"},{"name":"Mushroom Monster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922310/69e749ef6bec4e811066482d5aad24d8506049e6.jpg"},{"name":"Bounce","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3922310/6a145809da79e7b3b280b5ac1467768234d009d5.